00:05:29.529 --> 00:05:30.463
God knows who

00:05:30.463 --> 00:05:32.465
who saddles up to him in Mar-A-Lago.

00:05:32.465 --> 00:05:33.633
I mean, that's incredible.

00:05:35.835 --> 00:05:36.703
Well, it's because

00:05:36.703 --> 00:05:38.271
Trump prized information

00:05:38.271 --> 00:05:39.839
