00:06:18.945 --> 00:06:19.545
I mean,

00:06:19.779 --> 00:06:21.481
would that even have gotten out of the

00:06:21.481 --> 00:06:23.716
would? How would that work?

00:06:26.085 --> 00:06:27.153
Well, I think

00:06:27.153 --> 00:06:27.720
there are

00:06:27.720 --> 00:06:29.055
many people in the White House

00:06:29.055 --> 00:06:30.022
who would have

00:06:30.022 --> 00:06:31.724
who would have resisted that

00:06:31.724 --> 00:06:32.592
to the utmost

00:06:32.592 --> 00:06:34.260
until they were fired or resigned.

00:06:34.260 --> 00:06:35.261
Then you have the question,

00:06:35.261 --> 00:06:37.163
when that order goes to the Pentagon,

00:06:37.163 --> 00:06:39.031
what happens over there?

00:06:39.031 --> 00:06:40.466
It would have provoked

00:06:40.466 --> 00:06:41.401
would have certainly risked

00:06:41.401 --> 00:06:43.403
provoking a constitutional crisis.

00:06:43.403 --> 00:06:45.905
And that that was something that

00:06:45.905 --> 00:06:47.240
I think ultimately would

00:06:47.240 --> 00:06:49.142
it would have would have

00:06:49.142 --> 00:06:51.611
led to real problems with Trump thinking

00:06:51.611 --> 00:06:52.845
perhaps he could hold on.

00:06:52.845 --> 00:06:55.648
I mean, part of this is that Trump

00:06:56.115 --> 00:06:57.383
never knew any limits.

00:06:57.383 --> 00:06:59.786
And the closer he got to the end,

00:06:59.786 --> 00:07:01.621
the more inclined he was to

00:07:01.621 --> 00:07:03.423
to to push beyond any limits.

00:07:03.423 --> 00:07:04.690
Anybody had done before.

00:07:04.690 --> 00:07:05.525
And that's that's

00:07:05.525 --> 00:07:07.126
what was at stake at that meeting.

00:07:07.126 --> 00:07:07.560
I remember

00:07:07.560 --> 00:07:08.761
